- Quran text (quran.db, table "ayas"): Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net),
  files quran-simple-clean, quran-simple and quran-uthmani.
  Creative Commons Attribution 3.0. The text is distributed verbatim;
  changing it is not allowed. See TANZIL_LICENSE.txt.
- Roots (quran.db, tables "roots" and "root_words"): Quranic Universal
  Library (QUL) by Tarteel, "Word root" resource
  (https://qul.tarteel.ai/resources/morphology), under the terms QUL
  sets for that resource.
- Morphology (quran.db, table "morphology"): Quranic Arabic Corpus v0.4
  (https://corpus.quran.com), Kais Dukes, University of Leeds,
  GNU General Public License. Tags converted to Arabic grammatical terms.
  See QURANIC_CORPUS_LICENSE.txt.
- MASAQ.db: MASAQ - Morphologically-Analyzed and Syntactically-Annotated
  Quran Dataset, version 5, Sawalha et al., DOI: 10.17632/9yvrzxktmr,
  Creative Commons Attribution 3.0. The included copy has been MODIFIED
  (corrections documented in the docs/ folder).

